  "instagram_caption": "Mark ten numbers on a keno ticket. What are the odds all ten come up?\n\nKeno came from China. You mark up to 20 of 80 numbers, 20 are drawn, and there is no strategy at all. Keno pays back from under 70% to just over 80%, and hitting all 10 of 10 is about 1 in 8.9 million.\n\nEducation only. Not gambling advice. 18+\n\nDid you think some keno numbers were luckier than others?\n\n#theriggedgame #keno #howtoplay #casino #probability",
  "youtube_title": "How Keno Works, And The Odds Of Hitting All 10",
  "youtube_description": "Keno explained simply: 80 numbers, you mark up to 20, the casino draws 20 and pays by how many match. There is no strategy, paybacks run from under 70% to just over 80%, and catching all 10 of 10 is about 1 in 8.9 million.\n\nEducation only. Not gambling advice. 18+ AI narration.\n\nSources:\n• HowStuffWorks (John Grochowski), \"How to Play Keno\"\n\nThe Rigged Game: how casinos really work. Instagram: @the_rigged_game\n\n#Casino #Keno #Shorts"
 },
